From 3716b46effd53941d3dbf165e5ff0278dc5b22bb Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: kierandrewett <kieran@drewett.dev>
Date: Tue, 20 Oct 2026 21:23:03 +0100
Subject: [PATCH] gnoblin: replace center-new-windows with new-window-placement

Mutter side of the enum that replaces the boolean center-new-windows
preference: new-window-placement is one of free_space, center or cascade.
prefs.c reads it through APPLY_ENUM and exposes
meta_prefs_get_new_window_placement(); prefs.h adds MetaNewWindowPlacement.
The metatest and xdg-shell test helpers now set the string key.

Validation: applied on top of the series with git am; scratch tree
not built with tests (Mutter tests option disabled), so metatests are
not compiled here.
